==Strategy==
A very easy stage to overwhelm despite the scary-looking enemy lineup. Bring various long-ranged and/or piercing Super Rare attackers like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs Cat]], and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon Cat]], alongside a [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] as meatshields. Bring [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] or [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] if you want to ensure the enemies have no way of breaking through. As soon as the stage begins, kill Gabriel for some good money, then start stacking Super Rares to your heart's content. The stage is as good as beaten by that point, so long as you have a method to break Ribbo's Barrier.

